# Catalog Service HTTP Examples

## Получение всех книг

GET http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Война и мир",
    "author": "Л.Н. Толстой",
    "isbn": "978-5-222-01234-5",
    "categoryCode": "LIT",
    "price": 450.00,
    "stock": 10,
    "createdAt": "2025-01-01T10:00:00"
  }
]
```

---

## Получение книги по ID

GET http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Война и мир",
  "author": "Л.Н. Толстой",
  "isbn": "978-5-222-01234-5",
  "categoryCode": "LIT",
  "price": 450.00,
  "stock": 10,
  "createdAt": "2025-01-01T10:00:00"
}
```

### Response 404 Not Found
```json
{
  "error": "Book not found"
}
```

---

## Создание новой книги

POST http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "title": "Преступление и наказание",
  "author": "Ф.М. Достоевский",
  "isbn": "978-5-222-01235-2",
  "categoryCode": "LIT",
  "price": 380.00,
  "stock": 15
}
```

### Response 201 Created
```json
{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Преступление и наказание",
  "author": "Ф.М. Достоевский",
  "isbn": "978-5-222-01235-2",
  "categoryCode": "LIT",
  "price": 380.00,
  "stock": 15,
  "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:00:00"
}
```

---

## Обновление количества на складе

PUT http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books/1/stock?stock=20
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Война и мир",
  "author": "Л.Н. Толстой",
  "isbn": "978-5-222-01234-5",
  "categoryCode": "LIT",
  "price": 450.00,
  "stock": 20,
  "createdAt": "2025-01-01T10:00:00"
}
```

---

## Проверка наличия на складе

POST http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books/1/check-stock?quantity=5
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK (доступно)
```json
true
```

### Response 200 OK (недоступно)
```json
false
```

---

## Возврат товара на склад

POST http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/books/1/return-stock?quantity=3
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Stock updated successfully",
  "book": {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Война и мир",
    "author": "Л.Н. Толстой",
    "isbn": "978-5-222-01234-5",
    "categoryCode": "LIT",
    "price": 450.00,
    "stock": 23,
    "createdAt": "2025-01-01T10:00:00"
  }
}
```

---

## Получение всех категорий

GET http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/categories
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "code": "LIT",
    "name": "Художественная литература",
    "description": "Художественные книги"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "code": "SCI",
    "name": "Научная литература",
    "description": "Научные издания"
  }
]
```

---

## Получение категории по коду

GET http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/categories/LIT
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "LIT",
  "name": "Художественная литература",
  "description": "Художественные книги"
}
```

---

## Health Check

GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "status": "UP",
  "components": {
    "db": {
      "status": "UP",
      "details": {
        "database": "PostgreSQL",
        "validationQuery": "isValid()"
      }
    },
    "discoveryComposite": {
      "status": "UNKNOWN"
    },
    "ping": {
      "status": "UP"
    }
  }
}
```

---

## Prometheus Metrics

GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus

### Response 200 OK
```
# HELP jvm_memory_used_bytes The amount of memory used
# TYPE jvm_memory_used_bytes gauge
jvm_memory_used_bytes{area="heap",id="G1 Eden Space",} 1.23456789E8
jvm_memory_used_bytes{area="heap",id="G1 Old Gen",} 9.87654321E7
# HELP http_server_requests_seconds 
# TYPE http_server_requests_seconds summary
http_server_requests_seconds_count{method="GET",status="200",uri="/api/catalog/books",} 100
http_server_requests_seconds_sum{method="GET",status="200",uri="/api/catalog/books",} 5.678
```
